tween her and Moroha.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-01-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9q9S3h22Yx9fQhTot6liuH1j583.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9q9S3h22Yx9fQhTot6liuH1j583.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66919/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1371738","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Shizuno's brother tries to bully her into studying abroad, Moroha intervenes by revealing that he defeated the Dreadnought Class Metaphysical without any assistance. This leads to a high-stakes duel between himself and Sir Edward.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-02-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rXfJrKtjAsatzX5QXXhcaSBcCNJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rXfJrKtjAsatzX5QXXhcaSBcCNJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66919/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1371739","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Strikers go to a small island for a summer training camp, and Satsuki takes it upon herself to become a faster, more capable Savior. Meanwhile, the Head Six are preparing to meet regarding Moroha's suggested promotion to rank S.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-02-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/phsWWGljjYqaJ7vMkLiafOy3eMT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/phsWWGljjYqaJ7vMkLiafOy3eMT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66919/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1371740","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A gigantic Meta